### Criar usuario
POST http://localhost:8080/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pedro",
  "email": "pedro@email.com"
}

###
### Listar usuarios
GET http://localhost:8080/users

###
### Atualizar usuario
PUT http://localhost:8080/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pedro Atualizado",
  "email": "novo@email.com"
}

###
### Buscar usuario por ID
GET http://localhost:8080/users/1

###
### Deletar usuario
DELETE http://localhost:8080/users/1

###
### Buscar usuario apos deletar (deve retornar 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/users/1

###
### Criar usuario invalido (deve retornar 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "email-invalido"
}

###
### Criar transacao
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Salario",
  "amount": 5000.00,
  "type": "INCOME",
  "category": "Salary",
  "date": "2026-06-22",
  "userId": 1
}

###
### Listar transacoes
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions

###
### Buscar transacao por ID
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions/1

###
### Atualizar transacao
PUT http://localhost:8080/transactions/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Mercado",
  "amount": 250.75,
  "type": "EXPENSE",
  "category": "Food",
  "date": "2026-06-22",
  "userId": 1
}

###
### Deletar transacao
DELETE http://localhost:8080/transactions/1

###
### Criar transacao invalida (deve retornar 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "",
  "amount": 0,
  "type": "EXPENSE",
  "category": "",
  "date": "2026-06-22",
  "userId": 1
}
